#---
# purpose: "a recursive argument equation retains a fixed formal port outside its return dependencies"
#---
# n is a formal input even though only acc occurs in the recursive tuple.
# Its equation is int; acc's equation is :start | {acc}.
def build(0, acc), do: acc
def build(n, acc), do: build(n - 1, {acc})
def main(), do: dbg(build(3, :start))
